#: recipes/templates/recipes/index.html
msgid "Recipes"
msgstr "Rezepte"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/not_yet.html
msgid ""
"Adding and changing recipes is switched on by an admin, one person at a "
"time. Until then you can read every shared recipe."
msgstr ""
"Rezepte hinzufügen und ändern schaltet ein Admin frei, für jede Person "
"einzeln. Bis dahin kannst du alle geteilten Rezepte lesen."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Einstellungen"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "For menus and buttons, and the language recipes open in."
msgstr ""
"Für Menüs und Schaltflächen. Rezepte öffnen sich ebenfalls in dieser Sprache."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
#: recipes/templates/recipes/edit.html
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Speichern"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "Your account"
msgstr "Dein Konto"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "You can add and change recipes."
msgstr "Du kannst Rezepte hinzufügen und ändern."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "You can read every shared recipe. An admin can let you add your own."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst alle geteilten Rezepte lesen. Eigene hinzufügen kannst du, sobald "
"ein Admin dich freischaltet."

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "Change password"
msgstr "Passwort ändern"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
#: backoffice/templates/backoffice/base.html
msgid "Admin"
msgstr "Verwaltung"

#: accounts/templates/accounts/settings.html
msgid "Sign out"
msgstr "Abmelden"

